    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the draft for the new painkiller launch. We really want to push the \"Rapid Relief & Maximum Comfort\" angle to differentiate us from the generics in the market. Does our clinical data actually back up a campaign that emphasizes both the speed of action and a superior comfort profile?",
