      "content": "Please provide the relevant clinical data for me to analyze the claims. I can then help assess if the data strongly supports a \"Rapid Relief & Maximum Comfort\" marketing angle. We need to see objective evidence demonstrating a significant and measurable advantage in both speed and comfort over the competition to make the claim defensible.",
